{"name": "Light Dude", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/89fe933e48b520c9d4242c2f46ce4e52.avif?t=1785582980\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/fccef73e12bdf6e5a327b5267be932ef.poster.avif?t=1785582980\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/fccef73e12bdf6e5a327b5267be932ef.webm?t=1785582980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/fccef73e12bdf6e5a327b5267be932ef.mp4?t=1785582980\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Think before you move. Once you move, your vision gets limited, and only memory and reflexes can save you. How fast are your reactions in the dark?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/ba3c4dd87e2f3e8f2af4fde66f355add.avif?t=1785582980\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"236\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1e2b7283caa17fcf0ff5c0b06e8aa341.poster.avif?t=1785582980\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1e2b7283caa17fcf0ff5c0b06e8aa341.webm?t=1785582980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/1e2b7283caa17fcf0ff5c0b06e8aa341.mp4?t=1785582980\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From pros to casuals, choose how you want to play with customizable difficulty options. Adjust vision range in the dark and explore other accessibility-friendly settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/61ec537884440bf0fff7b314f0d0ae22.avif?t=1785582980\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/6857e5b606a8abdb08c5541281dd0f92.poster.avif?t=1785582980\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/6857e5b606a8abdb08c5541281dd0f92.webm?t=1785582980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/6857e5b606a8abdb08c5541281dd0f92.mp4?t=1785582980\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You only have a limited number of lights each level. Move and stop too often, and you\u2019ll run out of lights and be in total darkness for the rest of the stage!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/08a4f1706ec53d9a7ca53828cb9113e3.avif?t=1785582980\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"310\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d0f947f4392fb099ddfadb7c13e7488c.poster.avif?t=1785582980\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d0f947f4392fb099ddfadb7c13e7488c.webm?t=1785582980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/d0f947f4392fb099ddfadb7c13e7488c.mp4?t=1785582980\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each crystal and gem comes with its own unique challenge. Only the most skilled adventurers can uncover every lost treasure hidden in the darkness!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/8823963f84274b780a3dc61a87b19534.avif?t=1785582980\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/8cf9ba568a4232f445234a7845b8ec6c.poster.avif?t=1785582980\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/8cf9ba568a4232f445234a7845b8ec6c.webm?t=1785582980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/8cf9ba568a4232f445234a7845b8ec6c.mp4?t=1785582980\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Dr. Fog will do anything to keep the world in darkness. Only sharp reflexes, precise movement, and fearless determination will let you defeat his shadowy allies and ultimately face him!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" height=\"75\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/f71478483d838f9ec83d7ca99b4ff4c6.avif?t=1785582980\" width=\"780\"/></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/6acc128b1f241242cbbd25df6c97d53c.poster.avif?t=1785582980\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/6acc128b1f241242cbbd25df6c97d53c.webm?t=1785582980\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/extras/6acc128b1f241242cbbd25df6c97d53c.mp4?t=1785582980\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Want to feel every step? Jump into First-Person Mode for total immersion!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Demo is out now so give it a try!</strong></h2> </div>", "short_desc": "Move, and the level disappears. Stand still to reveal it. Scan the level, then step into the darkness. Dodge deadly traps, outmaneuver enemies, and defeat brutal bosses to reclaim the stolen sun. No map. No safety. Just your skill. Demo Out Now!", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3055110/869eff988d7d787919361111019d88ba4817acc4/header.jpg?t=1785582980", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Arcade", "Indie", "Difficult", "Action", "Experimental", "Psychological Horror"], "developers": "Dergham Games", "publishers": "Dergham Games", "release_date": "Q3 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "3055110", "review_type": "Not Recommended", "curator_desc": "27 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/rDxvzeRoYg0", "first_seen": 1774569600.0}